                        <div class="w-12 h-[1px] bg-gray-300"></div>
                        <span class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500">Our
                            Approach</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 mb-8">
                        ChimpzLab is a demand generation agency that connects performance marketing, email, automation
                        and vetted lead generation into one pipeline, so your marketing spend turns into qualified
                        demand instead of just clicks.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 mb-8">
                        A low cost-per-click means nothing if it never becomes a lead, and a lead means nothing if it
                        was never a real buyer. We build the whole path, from the ad to the landing page to the
                        follow-up, and we verify who is actually worth your sales team's time before we hand them over.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 mb-10">
                        The goal is a system that captures active intent and moves it forward on its own, so growth
